# Test fixtures must be committed. The bare pep/, cds/, gff3/ and genome/ rules above
# match those directory names anywhere in the tree, which otherwise silently swallows
# the synthetic inputs that `-profile test -stub-run` depends on — the pipeline would
# then run zero processes for anyone who clones the repo.
!nextflow/tests/data/input/
!nextflow/tests/data/input/pep/
!nextflow/tests/data/input/cds/
!nextflow/tests/data/input/gff3/
!nextflow/tests/data/input/dna/
!nextflow/tests/data/input/trna/
# Real-dataset AAFTF-SIF clean validation (conf/test_clean_real.config + samples/launcher/
# docs) must be committed like the synthetic tests/data/input fixtures above.
!nextflow/tests/
!nextflow/tests/real_clean/
!nextflow/tests/real_clean/**
# NCBI taxdump replicated by SETUP_TAXONDB storeDir (~533 MB) — never commit.
nextflow/lib/taxdump/
# Per-batch clean artefact that GENOME_CLEAN_BATCH emits to launchDir.
nextflow/TO_ADD_TO_SUPRESS.csv
